== Walkthrough ==

''[[Kinloc Flamepaw]] is located at 307, -664 in the Hall of Sorcery: the Qeynos Caster Guild Hall.''

You say, 'Hail, Kinloc Flamepaw'

: Kinloc Flamepaw says, 'Greetings, Teddee. I am Kinloc Flamepaw, Arch Magician of the Order of Three.'

'''Hand [[Kinloc Flamepaw]] [[a tattered note]]'''

:: ''a tattered note reads:''

:: <code>Summon forth the powers of the arcane. Seek out the mystic knowledge of the ancients. Give this scroll to Master Kinloc Flamepaw in the Hall of Sorcery, and submerge yourself in the ways of the Magician.</code>

: Kinloc Flamepaw says, 'Welcome to the Order of Three. I am Kinloc, guildmaster of the magicians. This tunic of the order is for you, wear it with honor. Study hard and master your skills, and you will become an important part of our order. Yestura shall help introduce you to the ways of magic.'

